   "actions": [
    {
     "field": "comment_value_html",
     "value": "<p>{{dc.signature_block}} Hello {{ticket.requester.first_name}},</p><p>Thanks for writing to us about your account. We read every message and we answer as soon as we can. Before you change anything, please make a backup of your profile and your messages. Then open the account settings and look at the list of addresses that belong to the account. Each alias needs its own identity in Thunderbird Desktop, not a separate account, so that replies go out from the right address in [[COUNTRY]] and everywhere else.</p><p>If you still have problems after that, reply to this message and tell us what you see.</p>"
    },
